{"version":1,"content":"<p>改編自80年代經典格鬥電視遊戲《街頭霸王》的《街霸》（Street Fighter）正在全球熱映中，片中除了有「中國」代表的格鬥家「春麗」之外，亦有同樣「好抽得」的「英國」代表「Cammy」。</p><p>該角色由澳洲泰國混血新星Mel Jarnson飾</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:41.350275+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:08:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.280151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.280151+00:00","content_hash":"007e63219052083d1b659a2eb832d88d6644c5566814654d778c783feb1b947f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}